An outcome is the business result a feature exists to move, stated so that someone
can check it after release. Features point at it with `outcome:`; a feature with none
is a PAC-002 warning while it is being drafted and a PAC-903 error once it ships.

The line's own numbers (`keelspec runs`) say whether the factory is healthy. This
says whether what it shipped mattered, and it is measured in production.
